name: campaign-threat-radar-zip
displayName: Campaign Threat Radar (ZIP)
author: local
description: Client-only campaign tactical radar: whole-map tactical view (all cores, spawns, enemies and weak sectors), realistic approach ETA, wave survival forecast, prioritized build advice, a terrain-aware selectable defense plan, and an optional off-by-default stage-1 autopilot that captures one local single-player Serpulo sector on Normal (pause/stop always available). Script (ZIP) version - do not enable together with the Java jar.
version: 1.8
minGameVersion: 154
hidden: true
